  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To support the collective voice and equal participation of women in leadership and decision making towards shaping national, regional and international policies.
2. To strengthen the capacities and raise the profile of (network) partners
3. To link (network) partners with strategic national, regional and international bodies
4. Strengthening WD programme coordination and implementation</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
